From: =?UTF-8?q?=E5=88=98=E5=8D=81=E4=BA=94?= <shiwenlongyes@163.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:31:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Kelivo chat history and model context sync

Pair DS Bot with the Kelivo sync server and import both user and assistant history through public Session APIs without waking agents. Persist receipts and replay markers so offline retries and restarts do not duplicate messages.

Validate with 437 plugin tests, 36 existing smoke steps, and actual DSH and Kelivo model-request roundtrips using a keyless mock bench. Replace the roster greeting test's fixed delay with an observable delivery condition.
